    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$8\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "Let the side length be $x$ centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^3&=512\\\\x&=\\sqrt[3]{512}\\\\x&=8\\end{align*}$$\nThe side length is $8\\text{ cm}$.",
